# Firebase service account private keys (never commit these).
# NOTE: google-services.json is intentionally NOT ignored — it only holds
# public identifiers and is required by the Android build.
# The leading `*` matters: the real key is named
# `ecommerce-<id>-firebase-adminsdk-<id>.json`, not `firebase-adminsdk-...`.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
